  Where to save it
  ui.theme = light

  This project's file sets this, so saving it everywhere won't change this repo.
  Save it for this project instead.

    1. Just this session       until you quit
    2. This project, just me   .argonauts/config.local.toml
    3. This project, shared    .argonauts/config.toml
  ❯ 4. Everywhere              ~/.argonauts/config.toml

  Enter to save · ↑↓ to move · type to filter · Esc to close
